      "message": "Preserve pending archives and harden direct publication recovery\n\nKeep newer full-vault preparations during background completion and roll back partial local selection writes. Allow explicit same-signature replay of unconfirmed native transactions on another node while retaining integrity failures and bounded response cancellation.\n\nAbort restore adoption after navigation, validate static source paths before writing, check artifact size and non-JS service dependencies, and prevent ambiguous or concurrent release upload retries in one evidence directory.\n\nAdd deterministic protocol and recovery failure cases, fresh offline decoder fixtures, and Chromium/Firefox/WebKit coverage. Preserve full dependency audit evidence, including build-tool findings. No upload, payment, deployment or ArNS update.",
